{"id": "JAH-LAYOUT-S-000001", "slug": "operation-layout-plans-signature", "title": "Operation Layout — Signature Pinning Board System", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "layout plan record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original layout method. The Signature Pinning Board is a wall-sized magnetic layout board where every station, tool, and material is a magnet pinned to the plan. Steps: (1) print the scaled plan on the board; (2) cut magnets for stations (red), tools (blue), materials (green); (3) pin the day's layout each morning; (4) move magnets as the operation shifts; (5) photograph the board at day's end for the record. The board makes the layout visible to the whole crew at a glance. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Print the scaled board plan", "Cut color-coded magnets", "Pin the morning layout", "Shift magnets with the operation", "Photograph the daily record"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature magnet count planner", "code": "const n=C.stations+C.tools+C.materials;assert(n===C.expected,'magnets');J({magnets_needed:n});", "verified_output": "{\"magnets_needed\":29}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Layout Plans Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Oul Captain System", "Signature Floating Oul Layout"], "sibling_edition": "operation-layout-plans"}}
{"id": "JAH-LAYOUT-S-000002", "slug": "operation-layout-plans-signature", "title": "Operation Layout — Signature Oul Captain System", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "layout plan record", "ladder_rank": 2, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original layout method. Each oul cell gets a named Oul Captain — the crew member who owns that cell's needs list, quality, and cleanup for the day. Steps: (1) grid and label the ouls; (2) name a captain per oul each morning; (3) captains pull their cell's needs list from the master; (4) captains sign off their cell complete; (5) rotate captains daily. Ownership per cell ends the 'somebody else's mess' problem. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Name captains per oul", "Pull cell needs lists", "Sign off completed cells", "Rotate captains daily", "Track captain performance"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature captain roster builder", "code": "assert(C.ouls.length===C.expected,'ouls');J({captains_needed:C.ouls.length,crew_available:C.crew});", "verified_output": "{\"captains_needed\":4,\"crew_available\":8}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Layout Plans Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Pinning Board System", "Signature Floating Oul Layout"], "sibling_edition": "operation-layout-plans"}}
{"id": "JAH-LAYOUT-S-000003", "slug": "operation-layout-plans-signature", "title": "Operation Layout — Signature Floating Oul Layout", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "layout plan record", "ladder_rank": 4, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original layout method. The Signature Floating Oul lets the grid move: oul cells are marked with reusable floor tiles instead of paint, so the layout re-grids in an hour when the operation changes phase. Steps: (1) lay interlocking numbered tiles for the first phase; (2) run the phase; (3) lift and re-lay the tiles for the next phase; (4) update the needs lists to the new cell map. Reconfigurable layouts for operations that change weekly. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Lay the numbered tile grid", "Run the phase on the grid", "Re-lay tiles for the next phase", "Update needs lists to the new map", "Store tiles between phases"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature tile count estimator", "code": "const n=C.cells*C.tiles_per_cell;assert(n===C.expected,'tiles');J({tiles_needed:n});", "verified_output": "{\"tiles_needed\":96}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Layout Plans Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Pinning Board System", "Signature Oul Captain System"], "sibling_edition": "operation-layout-plans"}}
{"id": "JAH-LAYOUT-S-000004", "slug": "operation-layout-plans-signature", "title": "Operation Layout — Signature Needs-List Auction", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated-completion", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "layout plan record", "ladder_rank": 6, "body": "Signature edition. Signature-original operations method. The Signature Needs-List Auction is a morning ritual: the day's needs lines are read aloud and crews claim them, so every line has a named owner before work starts. Unclaimed lines get assigned, never ignored. The ritual takes ten minutes and ends the day with zero orphan tasks. A Signature concept for study.", "capabilities": ["Read the day's needs lines aloud", "Let crews claim lines", "Assign unclaimed lines", "Verify zero orphan tasks", "Time-box the ritual to ten minutes"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Signature claim tracker", "code": "const o=C.lines-C.claimed;assert(o===C.expected_orphans,'orphans');J({orphan_lines:o});", "verified_output": "{\"orphan_lines\":3}", "verified_at": "2026-10-22", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt items 137-145", "last_verified": "2026-10-22", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress", "marker": "march to a million: in progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true, "throttled": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Layout Plans Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature Pinning Board System", "Signature Oul Captain System", "Signature Floating Oul Layout"], "sibling_edition": "operation-layout-plans"}}
